              <p style={{ fontSize:"0.9rem", lineHeight:1.7, color:"rgba(228,237,228,0.85)" }}>The Nuffer family traces back to Germany in the early 1800s. Johanne Gottlieb Nuffer (1807–1864) and Anna Marie Kastlein (1797–1870) are among the earliest known ancestors, with descendants eventually making their way to America — building families, farms, and futures across generations.</p>
